    "sub_name": "法文(三)",
    "sub_ename": "FRENCH(3)",
    "describe_ch": "修完法文(三)，學生應具備優秀的對話能力，包括各項活動、指引方向或道路、操作說明、表達健康需求等等。學生應學用法文表達需求、喜好、並使用現在及過去式時態。",
    "describe_eh": "After completing Level 3, a student should be skilled in dialogues about routine activities, giving directions, instructions, expressing one's health needs and describing a procedure or an approach. The student should be able to express wants, likes and dislikes, and converse in the present/past tense.",
